    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## fn_articles_get()\n\nAccepts article items as-is and:\n\nFor each article:\n\n1.  **Fetche** the full HTML page (`link`)\n2. Skip if fetch fails (HTTP error filtered out)\n3. **Extract** body text using `selector` (CSS)\n4. **Merge** extracted `article` text back into the article object",
