      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Input Contract\n\nEach incoming item should already be a single article object, for example:\n\n```\n{\n  title: '...',\n  link: '...',\n  pubDate: '...',\n  snippet: '...',\n  selector: '...'\n}\n```\n\n`fn_articles_get()` uses the incoming fields directly without expanding or normalizing batches.",
